# CPU cycles; panel bank 0 uses positive pressed-button masks.
# Select PG7 diagnostic menu, then PG8 MAX DELAY, through firmware scans.
2000000 button 0 0x40
2120000 button 0 0
2320000 button 0 0x80
2570000 button 0 0
2770000 snapshot max-delay
# ADC codes are 12-bit two's complement; gain pins are the original 2-bit code.
2800000 audio 512 0 0 0
2804096 audio 0 0 0 0
3600000 audio 0 0 3712 0
3604096 audio 0 0 0 0
4800000 snapshot after-audio
